put` - Input path for task events\n  - `job_input` - Input path for job events\n  - `output` - Output path for results\n  - `sesssize` - Session size threshold (default: 600 seconds)\n- Sets up Flink `StreamExecutionEnvironment` for stream processing\n- Currently contains a skeleton implementation (stub job execution)\n\n#### 2. Maven Configuration\n\n**File: `/app/workspace/pom.xml`** (215 lines)\n- **Project**: `clusterdata-analysis` (version 0.1)\n- **Java Target Version**: 11\n- **Flink Version**: 1.18.0\n- **Key Dependencies**:\n  - Apache Flink (streaming, Java, clients, walkthrough-common)\n  - Flink Kafka Connector (v1.17.0)\n  - Flink WikiEdits Connector (v1.18.0)\n  - Log4j (v2.17.1) for logging\n- **Build Plugins**:\n  - Maven Compiler Plugin\n  - Maven Assembly Plugin (configured to build `LongestSessionPerJob` as JAR with dependencies)\n\n#### 3. Data Files\n\n**Directory: `/app/workspace/data/`** (1.5 MB total)\n\n- **`ClusterData2011_2.md`** (8 KB)\n  - Documentation about Google Cluster Data 2011 traces\n  - Describes a 29-day dataset from May 2011 with ~12.5k machines\n  - Covers priorities (0-11 range), task usage sampling, known anomalies\n  - Mentions ~41GB total compressed trace size available in Google Storage\n\n- **`format.pdf`** (388 KB)\n  - Schema and format documentation for the cluster data\n  - Likely contains detailed field definitions and data structure specifications\n\n- **`job_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz`** (128 KB)\n  - Sample compressed CSV file (1 of 500 partitions)\n  - Contains job event records from the cluster trace\n\n- **`task_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz`** (908 KB)\n  - Sample compressed CSV file (1 of 500 partitions)\n  - Contains task event records from the cluster trace\n\n#### 4. Configuration Files\n\n**File: `/app/workspace/src/main/resources/log4j.properties`** (24 lines)\n- Logging configuration\n- Root logger level: INFO\n- Console appender with pattern layout\n- Timestamp format: HH:mm:ss,SSS\n\n### 